/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 194 0 R
/T (   They name the beast Sausage, I have no clue why they thought that was appropriate. As SoSo gains a big belly over the next few days, it is merely the first day of many that I am amazed. When they walk in with three bundles a few days later, I jump off my tree and sniff at the bundles, one at a time. With a flash of light, they grow into slightly bigger versions, two males and a female. They grow and learn new things, and I find myself sitting on Mother to scramble away from their little prying hands more than I like to admit. )
/E (   They name the beast Sausage, I have no clue why they thought that was appropriate. As SoSo gains a big belly over the next few days, it is merely the first day of many that I am amazed. When they walk in with three bundles a few days later, I jump off my tree and sniff at the bundles, one at a time. With a flash of light, they grow into slightly bigger versions, two males and a female. They grow and learn new things, and I find myself sitting on Mother to scramble away from their little prying hands more than I like to admit. )
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [0]
